      "widgets_values": [
        "## Iris-3B: monocular depth\n\nIris's depth fine-tune, folded into the base architecture (scripts/fold_depth.py). ComfyUI-Iris\nrecognises the file and returns the model output as the image.\n\n- **KSamplerAdvanced**: add_noise disable, steps 1, CFG 1, euler / simple.\n- **No ModelSamplingSD3** on this model (it would replace the depth sampling).\n- Output is relative log depth: dark = near, bright = far. Invert Image flips it.\n- Input size matters: below ~600 px the output turns blocky (16 px patches). The scale node\n  resizes to ~0.6 MP on a 16 px grid; raise it up to ~1.0 MP for more detail.\n"
      ]
